### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

### Ping Check
GET http://localhost:8080/ping
Accept: application/json

### Create API Key Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time_window": 5,
  "max_requests": 2,
  "blocked_duration": 5,
  "token_ttl": 3600
}

### Protected Endpoint (IP Rate Limit - no token)
GET http://localhost:8080/protected
Accept: application/json

### Protected Endpoint (Token Rate Limit - replace with generated token)
GET http://localhost:8080/protected
Accept: application/json
API_KEY: <replace-with-generated-token>
